{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53582","headline":"咏廿四气诗 小满四月中 · 元稹","name":"咏廿四气诗 小满四月中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小满气全时，如何靡草衰。\n田家私黍稷，方伯问蚕丝。\n杏麦修镰钐，錋苽{下爲爪}竪棘篱。\n向来看苦菜，独秀也何爲？\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}